# 🎪 EVENTRA

### Where Campus Events Become Experiences.

**Plan. Connect. Participate. Remember.**

Eventra reimagines college event management as a single digital ecosystem — bringing events, registrations, participation, attendance and feedback into one connected experience.

---

### ✦ THE IDEA

College events often involve scattered registrations, manual attendance, separate announcements and disconnected feedback.

**Eventra brings the entire journey together.**

```text
DISCOVER
   ↓
REGISTER
   ↓
SCAN
   ↓
PARTICIPATE
   ↓
TRACK
   ↓
FEEDBACK
```

### ⚡ WHAT MAKES IT DIFFERENT

🎟️ Event & registration management
📱 QR-based participation
📊 Attendance tracking
💬 Feedback collection
🎁 Voucher / reward concepts
👥 Role-based access
📁 Fest file management
🤖 AI-assisted attendance & feedback concepts

### 🧩 TECHNOLOGY

`PHP` `Laravel` `MySQL` `phpMyAdmin` `Tailwind CSS` `GSAP`

### 🎯 THE GOAL

Not just another event-management application.

**A smarter digital layer for campus life.**

### 🚀 STATUS

**Built as a practical college-event management solution.**
